[node name="Label" type="Label" parent="MarginContainer/VBoxContainer"]
layout_mode = 2
theme_override_fonts/font = ExtResource("3_go4tg")
text = "Tutorial:
Your Quest is to make your way through the fabled Everglade
 and defeat the dreaded stone monster that has taken over the forest, 
corrupting it and bringing with it unwanted enemies which have taken over the once 
prosperous glade.

You will make use of your handy bow and arrow to navigate the clearings in the forest,
defeating any monsters that may come in your way, to reach and defeat the evil stone monster.
You will also use your stamina to escape in tricky situations by sprinting away.

Be careful however, as even though you are an elf, you are still mortal and by undertaking this
quest you are putting yourself at risk for the greater good of the Everglade.

Thank you young adventurer, may the spirits of the forest be with you on this epic quest.


"
horizontal_alignment = 1

[node name="quit" type="Button" parent="MarginContainer/VBoxContainer"]
layout_mode = 2
theme_override_fonts/font = ExtResource("3_go4tg")
text = "Return to Main Menu"

[connection signal="pressed" from="MarginContainer/VBoxContainer/quit" to="." method="_on_quit_pressed"]
